{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "RC live endpoint probe contract. SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for endpoint paths and expected status codes. Edit ONLY this file when paths change -- never hardcode in scripts. Tier-1 (T1) = must pass before any demo/RC; protected by hash lock. Tier-2 (T2) = nice-to-have, not CI-blocking.",
